1.0.5 2026-10-31

  - Rescale joint-angle channels to radians in the BDF headers
  - Version 1.0.2 (31 August 2026) relabelled the joint-angle channels from uV to rad
    without rescaling their physical range, so readers such as MNE returned joint
    angles 1,000,000 times too large (up to about 2,000,000 rad). The physical
    minimum and maximum of the joint channels are now divided by 1,000,000 and
    labelled rad in 24,995 BDF headers. Digital samples, digital limits and the EMG
    channels are unchanged; the 258 recordings with flat joint channels (range 0 to 1)
    are unchanged. Script: sourcedata/code/rescale_joint_physical_range.py.
